      "writtenOn": "2016-12-14T18:27:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The naming depends on the direction in which we\u0027re trying to convert the structure.\n\nIn |convertLegacyRoamingCapabilitiesToHidl|, we\u0027re taking an instance of |wifi_roaming_capabilities| from legacy HAL API and converting to it\u0027s HIDL equivalent struct.\n\nIn |convertHidlRoamingConfigToLegacy|, we\u0027re taking an instance of |StaRoamingConfig| from HIDL interface and converting to it\u0027s legacy HAL equivalent struct.",
